{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Luxa RAW Camera 是一款主打減少手機過度處理的 iPhone 拍攝 App，適合希望保留自然紋理、又不想被複雜流程綁住的攝影愛好者。它支援在相容裝置上拍攝 RAW 與 ProRAW，亦可使用手動 ISO 與快門控制。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-51.webp\">\n<h2>減少處理保留真實質感</h2>\n<p>Luxa RAW Camera 以較剋制的處理方式，盡量保留皮膚、頭髮、布料、植物與建築等日常場景的自然紋理；在相容裝置上可拍攝 RAW 或 ProRAW，亦支援手動調整 ISO 與快門速度。想快速分享時，可使用 Apple 影像處理流程輸出 HEIF，並為照片加入簡潔浮水印與拍攝資訊。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-448-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-449-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-450-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-451-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-452-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-453-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Luxa RAW Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.414355+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:05:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T21:38:36.584368+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:30.791078+00:00","content_hash":"4248cbdd3279dceaff3a72104c7f6f27d6f383b7de5673df71624230bcbe9ea1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}